00:15:44.370 --> 00:15:46.750
And the changes that I
want to also see is also

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:48.923
related to this, because,

00:15:48.923 --> 00:15:52.730
for the fields, this fairness is

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:55.100
by nature is interdisciplinary.

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:56.653
And as you can see from
the panel (chuckles)

00:15:56.653 --> 00:15:59.930
that we are talking about is
also from different backgrounds

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:03.350
because the problem needs
people coming from different

00:16:04.550 --> 00:16:07.180
backgrounds to think about the solutions.

00:16:07.180 --> 00:16:09.370
One of the things about the AI is that,

00:16:09.370 --> 00:16:13.470
most of the research is
