at least a very new
initiative on a global basis

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:41.523
which is called GPAI, the
Global Partnership on AI.

00:17:43.530 --> 00:17:45.570
I'm sure I'm not the youngest on the panel

00:17:45.570 --> 00:17:48.520
but I'm the newest one in the AI sector,

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:49.580
'cause as you mentioned before,

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:52.560
I come more from a legal
background and international level

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:56.170
