00:44:28.350 --> 00:44:29.940
just touch on where they should go,

00:44:29.940 --> 00:44:32.433
and what they should if
they want to learn more?

00:44:33.680 --> 00:44:35.850
- Yes, sure, first where they should go,

00:44:35.850 --> 00:44:38.450
two things, there's a
website for the GPAI,

00:44:38.450 --> 00:44:41.700
so gpai.ai, and I can share
that on the chat after,

00:44:41.700 --> 00:44:44.220
and then there's also a webpage for

00:44:44.220 --> 00:44:46.690
the (murmurs), which will be, you know,

00:44:46.690 --> 00:44:47.530
improved over time.

00:44:47.530 --> 00:44:51.070
But that's the two easy access
to get more information.

00:44:51.070 --> 00:44:53.290
In terms of how individual
can be involved,

00:44:53.290 --> 00:44:56.720
first, within the the
terms of reference the GP,

00:44:56.720 --> 00:44:59.270
